@startuml "Watch Communication"

!theme cerulean
title iPhone ↔ Watch Communication

box "iPhone" #LightBlue
  participant "OsmoCameraManager" as Mgr
  participant "WatchBridge" as Bridge
end box

participant "WCSession" as WC

box "Apple Watch" #LightGreen
  participant "WatchViewModel" as WVM
  participant "WatchControlView" as WCV
end box

== State Push (iPhone → Watch, 1 Hz) ==

Mgr -> Bridge : Observable state changes
Bridge -> Bridge : pushStateIfChanged()\n  (1 Hz timer)

Bridge -> Bridge : Build context dict:\n  connectedCount, enabledCount,\n  currentMode, isRecording,\n  batteryPercent, timestamp

Bridge -> Bridge : Compare with\n  lastPushedContext\n  (skip if identical)

Bridge -> WC : updateApplicationContext(\n  context)

note right of WC
  Queued by system.
  Works even when watch
  is unreachable (e.g.
  screen dimmed).
end note

WC --> WVM : session(_:\n  didReceiveApplicationContext:)
WVM -> WVM : applyContext(dict)\n  Update all state properties

WVM -> WCV : @Observable triggers\n  view re-render

== Command (Watch → iPhone) ==

actor "Watch User" as WU

WU -> WCV : Tap shutter button
WCV -> WVM : shutterAll()
WVM -> WC : sendMessage(\n  ["action": "shutterAll"],\n  replyHandler: { _ in })

note left of WC
  MUST use non-nil replyHandler
  to dispatch to correct delegate
  method on iPhone side.

  Requires iPhone app in foreground.
  isReachable drops when watch
  screen dims.
end note

WC --> Bridge : session(_:\n  didReceiveMessage:\n  replyHandler:)

Bridge -> Mgr : shutterAll()
Mgr -> Mgr : Execute on all cameras

Bridge --> WC : replyHandler(["ok": true])
Bridge -> Bridge : pushStateIfChanged()\n  (immediate update)

== Mode Switch (Watch → iPhone) ==

WU -> WCV : Select mode in picker
WCV -> WVM : switchMode("photo")
WVM -> WC : sendMessage(\n  ["action": "switchMode",\n   "mode": "photo"])
WC --> Bridge : didReceiveMessage
Bridge -> Mgr : switchModeAll(.photo)
Bridge --> WC : reply
Bridge -> Bridge : pushStateIfChanged()
WC --> WVM : didReceiveApplicationContext\n  (updated mode)

WVM -> WCV : currentMode changed
WCV -> WCV : Update picker\n  (isSyncingMode guard\n   prevents feedback loop)

@enduml
